 quantities, Units, Measurements, Errors</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/physics-mechanics/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Unit 2: Motion and Energy</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Kinematics, Newton's Laws, Work, Energy, Power</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/physics-properties/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Unit 3: Properties of Matter</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Elasticity, Surface Tension, Fluid Dynamics</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/physics-heat/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Unit 4: Heat &amp; Thermodynamics</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Temperature, Heat, Laws of Thermodynamics</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/physics-electricity/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Unit 5: Electricity &amp; Magnetism</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Electrostatics, Current, Magnetism, Induction</p>\n      </a>\n\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/physics/physics-waves/\" class=\"block rounded-xl bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm border p-5 hover:shadow-md transition group\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-700 group-hover:text-blue-500\">Unit 6: Waves &amp; Optics</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-500 mt-1\">Wave